{"path":"numeric/math/fdim","title":"fdim, fdimf, fdiml","titleHtml":"fdim, fdimf, fdiml","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/c/numeric/math/fdim","section":"numeric","kind":"page","summary":"If successful, returns the positive difference between x and y.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/c/numeric/math\"><code>&lt;math.h&gt;</code></a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-c99\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\"><span class=\"kw4\">float</span> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; fdimf<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">float</span> x, <span class=\"kw4\">float</span> y <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c99\">(since C99)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-c99\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\"><span class=\"kw4\">double</span> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;fdim<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">double</span> x, <span class=\"kw4\">double</span> y <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c99\">(since C99)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-c99\" id=\"Version_3\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\"><span class=\"kw4\">long</span> <span class=\"kw4\">double</span> fdiml<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">long</span> <span class=\"kw4\">double</span> x, <span class=\"kw4\">long</span> <span class=\"kw4\">double</span> y <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (3) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c99\">(since C99)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/c/numeric/tgmath\"><code>&lt;tgmath.h&gt;</code></a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-c99\" id=\"Version_4\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\"><span class=\"co2\">#define fdim( x, y )</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (4) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c99\">(since C99)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1-3)</span> Returns the positive difference between <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\">x</span></code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\">y</span></code>, that is, if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\">x<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>y</span></code>, returns <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\">x<span class=\"sy2\">-</span>y</span></code>, otherwise (if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\">x≤y</span></code>), returns +0.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">4)</span> Type-generic macro: If any argument has type <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\"><span class=\"kw4\">long</span> <span class=\"kw4\">double</span></span></code>, <code>fdiml</code> is called. Otherwise, if any argument has integer type or has type <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\"><span class=\"kw4\">double</span></span></code>, <code>fdim</code> is called. Otherwise, <code>fdimf</code> is called.</div>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> x, y\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> floating-point value\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>If successful, returns the positive difference between <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\">x</span></code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\">y</span></code>.\n</p><p>If a range error due to overflow occurs, <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/c/numeric/math/HUGE_VAL\">+HUGE_VAL</a></span>, <code>+HUGE_VALF</code>, or <code>+HUGE_VALL</code> is returned.\n</p><p>If a range error due to underflow occurs, the correct value (after rounding) is returned.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Error_handling\">Error handling</h3>\n<p>Errors are reported as specified in Template:rllpt.\n</p><p>If the implementation supports IEEE floating-point arithmetic (IEC 60559),\n</p>\n<ul><li> If either argument is NaN, NaN is returned.\n</li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\n<p>Equivalent to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\"><a href=\"/w/c/numeric/math/fmax\"><span class=\"kw651\">fmax</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>x<span class=\"sy2\">-</span>y, <span class=\"nu0\">0</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> except for the NaN handling requirements.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"c\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;errno.h&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;fenv.h&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;math.h&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co1\">// #pragma STDC FENV_ACCESS ON</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">void</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/c/io/fprintf\"><span class=\"kw850\">printf</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"fdim(4, 1) =&nbsp;%f, fdim(1, 4)=%f<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span>, fdim<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">4</span>,<span class=\"nu0\">1</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, fdim<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span>,<span class=\"nu0\">4</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/c/io/fprintf\"><span class=\"kw850\">printf</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"fdim(4,-1) =&nbsp;%f, fdim(1,-4)=%f<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span>, fdim<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">4</span>,<span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, fdim<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span>,<span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"nu0\">4</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"co1\">//error handling</span>\n    <span class=\"kw2\">errno</span> <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu0\">0</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <a href=\"/w/c/numeric/fenv/feclearexcept\"><span class=\"kw717\">feclearexcept</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/c/numeric/fenv/FE_exceptions\"><span class=\"kw728\">FE_ALL_EXCEPT</span></a><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/c/io/fprintf\"><span class=\"kw850\">printf</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"fdim(1e308, -1e308) =&nbsp;%f<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span>, fdim<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu19\">1e308</span>, <span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"nu19\">1e308</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">if</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw2\">errno</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> <a href=\"/w/c/error/errno_macros\"><span class=\"kw478\">ERANGE</span></a><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/c/io/perror\"><span class=\"kw878\">perror</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"    errno == ERANGE\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">if</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/c/numeric/fenv/fetestexcept\"><span class=\"kw718\">fetestexcept</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/c/numeric/fenv/FE_exceptions\"><span class=\"kw732\">FE_OVERFLOW</span></a><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/c/io/puts\"><span class=\"kw835\">puts</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"    FE_OVERFLOW raised\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Possible output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>fdim(4, 1) = 3.000000, fdim(1, 4)=0.000000\nfdim(4,-1) = 5.000000, fdim(1,-4)=5.000000\nfdim(1e308, -1e308) = inf\n    errno == ERANGE: Numerical result out of range\n    FE_OVERFLOW raised</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"References\">References</h3>\n<div class=\"t-ref-std-23\">\n<ul><li> C23 standard (ISO/IEC 9899:2024): \n</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 7.12.12.1 The fdim functions (p: TBD)\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 7.25 Type-generic math &lt;tgmath.h&gt; (p: TBD)\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> F.10.9.1 The fdim functions (p: TBD)\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<div class=\"t-ref-std-17\">\n<ul><li> C17 standard (ISO/IEC 9899:2018): \n</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 7.12.12.1 The fdim functions (p: 187-188)\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 7.25 Type-generic math &lt;tgmath.h&gt; (p: 272-273)\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> F.10.9.1 The fdim functions (p: 386)\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<div class=\"t-ref-std-11\">\n<ul><li> C11 standard (ISO/IEC 9899:2011): \n</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 7.12.12.1 The fdim functions (p: 257)\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 7.25 Type-generic math &lt;tgmath.h&gt; (p: 373-375)\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> F.10.9.1 The fdim functions (p: 530)\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<div class=\"t-ref-std-c99\">\n<ul><li> C99 standard (ISO/IEC 9899:1999): \n</li></ul>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 7.12.12.1 The fdim functions (p: 238)\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> 7.22 Type-generic math &lt;tgmath.h&gt; (p: 335-337)\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n<dl><dd><ul><li> F.9.9.1 The fdim functions (p: 466)\n</li></ul>\n</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/c/numeric/math/abs\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>abs</span><span>labs</span><span>llabs</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span></span><span></span><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c99\">(C99)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>   computes absolute value of an integral value (<span class=\"mjax-fallback texhtml\" data-tex=\"\\small{|x|}\">|x|</span>)  <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/c/numeric/math/fmax\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>fmax</span><span>fmaxf</span><span>fmaxl</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c99\">(C99)</span></span><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c99\">(C99)</span></span><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c99\">(C99)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>   determines larger of two floating-point values  <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div class=\"t-dsc-see\"><span><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/math/fdim\">C++ documentation</a></span> for <span class=\"t-dsc-see-tt\"><span>fdim</span></span></div>\n</td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Error handling","id":"Error_handling"},{"depth":3,"text":"Notes","id":"Notes"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"References","id":"References"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C reference"},{"path":"numeric","title":"Numerics"},{"path":"numeric/math","title":"Common mathematical functions"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"fdim, fdimf, fdiml","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"4 declarations. Returns the positive difference between x and y, that is, if x>y, returns x-y, otherwise (if x≤y), returns +0."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"x, y"},{"label":"Return value","note":"If successful, returns the positive difference between x and y."},{"label":"Error handling","note":"Errors are reported as specified in Template:rllpt."},{"label":"Notes","note":"Equivalent to fmax(x-y, 0) except for the NaN handling requirements."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"abs, labs, llabs","note":"computes absolute value of an integral value (|x|)"},{"label":"fmax, fmaxf, fmaxl","note":"determines larger of two floating-point values"}]}]},"standards":["C99"],"wordCount":380,"codeBlockCount":2}
